      "message": "Ack.  I can do whatever works for you.  One reason why I decided to use pragmas is to opt into those warnings everywhere (e.g. not just in Skia Bazel builds, or Skia GN builds).  One reason is that for most features my development of `SkPngRustCodec` is driven by Chromium/Blink tests (and so I build `SkPngRustCodec.cpp` and its transitive deps using Chromium\u0027s GN/ninja).",
